Comment:
 DRAFT generated from a read-only audit of the git tree at v1.9.0 (HEAD
 f1dd240d). Statements are tagged [H] = verified from a header or notice in
 the tree, [G] = verified from git history of this repository, [W] =
 verified against the upstream project's published files, [A] = assumed.
 See license-audit.md for path:line evidence and the open questions.
 .
 Files-Excluded rationale (all provisional, maintainer to confirm):
 the five docs/images/*dns*format.png files carry the visible watermark
 "The TCP/IP Guide" (tcpipguide.com, all rights reserved) [verified by
 viewing the images; referenced from docs/DNS-protocol.md:18,23,70,85,116] and
 are not redistributable under DFSG. src/mmt_mobile/asn1c/support holds
 3GPP TS 36.413 / 38.413 ASN.1 modules with no copyright or redistribution
 notice; they are only inputs for regenerating the (committed) asn1c output
 and are not needed to build. docs/_site and docs/.jekyll-cache are git-ignored
 Jekyll build output (bundles cayman CSS + normalize.css) and appear only in
 a working-tree snapshot.
 .
 Not excluded but still unresolved (see license-audit.md, sections 5 and 8):
 pcaps of unknown provenance under tools/phase0/ci/pcaps/ and
 src/examples/google-fr.pcap; the Montimage logo docs/assets/montimage-logo.svg
 and docs/favicon.ico; the IP-range and hostname tables
 src/mmt_tcpip/lib/mmt_tcpip_classif_proto_ip_address.inc and
 src/mmt_tcpip/lib/mmt_tcpip_classif_doted_host_names.inc.
 .
 CRITICAL, NOT REFLECTED BELOW BECAUSE PER-FILE NOTICES WERE STRIPPED
 UPSTREAM: about 120 protocol classifiers under src/mmt_tcpip/lib/protocols/
 (listed in opendpi-idiom-files.txt) and src/mmt_tcpip/lib/*.h are structurally
 derived from OpenDPI (ipoque GmbH) / nDPI (ntop.org), which are
 LGPL-3+ [G: commit 38be508d contains OPENDPI_/IPOQUE_ identifiers and
 ntop_* function names; commit 1e45e3a2 renamed them]. The Files: * stanza
 below (Apache-2.0) is only correct for these files if Montimage can show
 they are independent works or holds a licence that permits it.

