Comment:
 Explicit per-file GPL-3+ header, lines 2-25 of each file (GPL text at
 lines 5-7 and 12) [H]. Conflicts with
 the top-level Apache-2.0 claim. Built only with ENABLESEC=1, but the release
 .deb is built with ENABLESEC=1 (tools/ci/build-package.sh) [H per
 docs/AGENT_ENVIRONMENT.md sec. 1], so libmmt_security ships. Montimage holds the
 copyright and can relicense to Apache-2.0 (remove the header) if all
 later contributors agree [A]. Until then libmmt_security.so must be
 described as GPL-3+.

