Files: src/mmt_mobile/asn1c/s1ap/*
 src/mmt_mobile/asn1c/ngap/*
 src/mmt_mobile/asn1c/common/EXTERNAL.c
 src/mmt_mobile/asn1c/common/EXTERNAL.h
 src/mmt_mobile/asn1c/common/S1AP-PDU.c
 src/mmt_mobile/asn1c/common/S1AP-PDU.h
 src/mmt_mobile/asn1c/common/asn_constant.h
Copyright: Montimage
License: Apache-2.0
Comment:
 Machine-generated by "asn1c-0.9.29 (http://lionet.info/asn1c)" from the
 3GPP S1AP (TS 36.413) and NGAP (TS 38.413) ASN.1 modules [H: banner lines 2-5
 of every file, 1841 of 1841 s1ap+ngap files]. Files carry no copyright or
 licence statement. Status of the output is [A]: (1) asn1c places no
 restriction on generated output beyond its BSD runtime [A], (2) 3GPP/ETSI
 rights in the ASN.1 source may extend to the derived structure definitions
 [A, unresolved]. EXTERNAL.* is generated from asn1c's own standard module
 ASN1C-UsefulInformationObjectClasses.asn1 (banner line 3) [H]; asn_constant.h
 is generated from the asn1c skeleton [H]. Do not hand-edit (CLAUDE.md hard
 rule); regenerate with asn1c 0.9.29 if the specs are made available.

